    "created_at": "2015-09-09T08:55:51Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-09T08:55:51Z",
    "body": "Blink do A for `<dialog>`. For fullscreen, I believe all browsers currently still use `:root:fullscreen-ancestor { overflow: hidden; }`, which is the third way I mentioned.\n\nHowever, we have removed `:fullscreen-ancestor` long ago. In addition, as we've also removed the hierarchy restriction, it now becomes hard to maintain that pseudo-class efficiently.\n\n(Also, changing `overflow` property is expensive in Gecko, hence I want to get rid of it anyway)\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
