    "created_at": "2016-06-29T14:54:38Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-29T14:54:38Z",
    "body": "This is a problem in https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=543946\n\nBefore trying to figure out how to make `<dialog>` and Fullscreen work together, do we all agree that for Fullscreen it would make the most sense if scrollbars of any ancestors are not visible? If they are, then what effect should using them actually have?\n",
