    "created_at": "2016-06-30T01:04:22Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-30T01:04:22Z",
    "body": "In fullscreen, all ancestors up to the root of the document should already have been hidden behind `::backdrop` by default, so it doesn't make sense to hide their scrollbars.\n\nThe only question is the viewport, which is still a geometry parent of top layer elements.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
